      "text": "MAHALAGANG ABISO SA MGA MOTORISTA🚦\n\nPansamantalang isasara ang kahabaan ng Buenamar Drive mula Gen. Luis St. hanggang Lourdes St., simula bukas, Disyembre 30, 2025, 10:00PM. Ito ay para sa pagdaraos ng Distrito Singko, Mag-Ingay Tayo! Nova Countdown to 2026 na gaganapin sa Nova Park, Novaliches Bayan.\n\nNaglatag naman ng alternatibong ruta ang Traffic and Transport Management Department o TTMD:\n\nFor Light Vehicles Only\nFrom Gen. Luis going to Quirino Highway (Via Doña Rosario)\nRight – Doña Rosario\nLeft – Maagap\nStraight – Lourdes\nRight – Petronia\nLeft – Buenamar Dr\nRight – Sarmiento\nTo point of destination\n\nFor all kinds of vehicles\nFrom Gen. Luis going to Quirino Highway (Via Doña Rosario)\nRight– Doña Rosario\nLeft – Maagap\nStraight – Lourdes\nRight– Buenamar\nLeft – Sarmiento \nTo point of destination\n\nFor light vehicles only\nFrom SM Novaliches Quirino Highway going to Mindanao EXTN; Quirino Highway Zabarte; Lagro and Fairview (Via Forest Hill Drive)\nRight– Forest Hill Drive\nLeft – Don Santiago\nRight – Mt Everest\nRight – Cresta Verde Ave\nLeft – Mindanao Ave\nStraight – Mindanao Ave\nTo point of destination\n\nFrom Quirino Highway going to Katipunan Avenue; Gen Luis (Via P Dela Cruz)\nLeft – P Dela Cruz\nStraight – P Dela Cruz\nLeft – East Berkeley\nRight – Katipunan Avenue\nTo point of destination",
